## What Phase 4 will add

The following MASVS control groups require the dynamic, native, and
orchestrator MCP servers (Phase 2–4) for full coverage:

- **MASVS-AUTH** — authentication flow analysis (dynamic).
- **MASVS-CRYPTO** — algorithm and key strength review (decompile + static).
- **MASVS-RESILIENCE-1/2/3/4/5** — runtime root/hook/tamper/emulator/debug detection (dynamic).
- **MASVS-RESILIENCE-7** — obfuscation analysis (native + decompile).
- **MASVS-STORAGE-1/2/3** — sensitive data at rest (decompile).
- **MASVS-PRIVACY-3** — runtime logging (dynamic logcat + decompile).

To upgrade, install the Phase 4 components and re-run with the
`android-re-triage-orchestrator` skill.
